    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Spectacle of Spite",
    "summary": "As your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) starts, choose which Combat Drugs your army has active until your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) starts, in one of 2 ways:\n\n- Pick 1 from the list; each Combat Drug can be picked this way once per battle.\n- Roll 2 D6 to choose 2 at random. Random picks may repeat earlier drugs, but a result that is active already adds nothing.\n\nEach drug, listed with its D6 result, affects **WYCH CULT** models in your army:\n\n- **Adrenalight** (1): +1 Attacks on melee weapons.\n- **Hypex** (2): +2\" Move.\n- **Serpentin** (3): melee weapons' Weapon Skill improves by 1.\n- **Painbringer** (4): +1 Toughness.\n- **Grave Lotus** (5): +1 Strength on melee weapons.\n- **Splintermind** (6): Leadership improves by 1, and ranged weapons' Ballistic Skill improves by 1.",
